From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Kopco <hey@oddcelot.dev>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:10:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] sys: route wasm syscalls to bun_sys_host symbols

open/read/write/pread/pwrite/lseek/close, the stat family, mkdir, unlink, rename, getcwd and
directory iteration call extern bun_sys_host_* symbols (ABI documented in wasm_impl.rs) instead of
returning ENOSYS. Fd::close closes through the host too. The final wasm crate defines the symbols.
